{"suttaId":"tha-ap509","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[3109,3126],"vripara":"74"},"segments":{"tha-ap509:0.3":"Ajeliphaladāyakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap509:1.1":"“Ajjuno [ajino (syā.)] nāma sambuddho, himavante vasī tadā;","tha-ap509:1.3":"Caraṇena ca sampanno, samādhikusalo muni.","tha-ap509:2.1":"“Kumbhamattaṃ gahetvāna, ajeliṃ [añjaliṃ (syā.), ajelaṃ (pī.)] jīvajīvakaṃ;","tha-ap509:2.3":"Chattapaṇṇaṃ gahetvāna, adāsiṃ satthuno ahaṃ.","tha-ap509:3.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe, yaṃ phalaṃ adadiṃ tadā;","tha-ap509:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, phaladānassidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap509:4.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap509:5.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap509:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap509:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ajeliphaladāyako thero imā Gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap509:8.1":"Ajeliphaladāyakattherassāpadānaṃ sattamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
